A '''Guitarist''' (Japanese: '''ギタリスト''' ''Guitarist'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in [[Generation II]] games. They appear as young, blond men or (in [[Generation V]] only) black haired women, playing guitars.

They specialize in {{type|Electric}} Pokémon, as they play {{wp|electric guitar}}s. They may also use Pokémon associated with sound waves, such as the {{p|Whismur}} evolutionary line in [[Generation III]], and the {{p|Zubat}}{{sup/4|DP}}{{sup/8|BDSP}}/{{p|Kricketot}}{{sup/4|Pt}} family in [[Generation IV]] and [[Generation VIII]]. They may have some relation to the {{tc|Rocker}} class introduced in [[Generation I]], and the {{Tc|Musician}} class introduced in [[Generation V]].

