==In animation==
[[File:Billy Jo.png|thumb|250px|Guitarist Billy Jo in {{aniseries|BW}}]]
{{an|May}} battled {{OBP|Jeremy|AG151}}, who seems to be based on the Guitarist class, in ''[[AG151|Weekend Warrior]]''. However, he owned a {{p|Venusaur}} and a {{p|Butterfree}}, which are not Electric-type like the Guitarists use in the {{pkmn|games}}. However, {{p|Butterfree}} are capable of using {{m|Supersonic|sound waves}} in the games, possibly referencing the Trainer class.

In ''[[BW083|Rocking the Virbank Gym! Parts 1]] [[BW084|and 2]]'', a Guitarist named [[Billy Jo]] appeared as a member of [[Roxie]]'s rock band "{{p|Koffing}} and the Toxics".

In ''[[XY115|Battling at Full Volume!]]'', a Guitarist named {{OBP|Jimmy|XY115}} arrived at the camp of {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} with the intent of testing the strength of his {{p|Pikachu}}, Spike, against [[Ash's Pikachu]]. Unbeknownst to him, however, the Trainer he battled was {{an|Serena}}, who disguised herself as Ash to stand in for him after he had fallen ill.
