==Trivia==
* In {{game|Platinum}}, Guitarist Arturo can be found in these [[Pokémon Center]] locations around Sinnoh:
:'''Sunday, Wednesday, Saturday''': [[Pastoria City]]
:'''Monday, Tuesday''': [[Canalave City]]
:'''Thursday, Friday''': [[Sunyshore City]]
* There is data in Pokémon Platinum for a battle with Guitarist Arturo with a [[level]] 7 {{p|Kricketot}}, but it is completely inaccessible.<ref>https://www.smogon.com/forums/threads/pokemon-platinum-trainer-data.3665884/</ref>
* From [[Generation II]] to [[Generation V]], the type of guitar used by Guitarists is based on the well-known guitars of {{wp|Gibson}}.
* Many Guitarists found in various Battle Frontiers are likely references to famous real-life guitarists, including Iggy (Pop), Jimmie (Jimi Hendrix), and Les (Paul).

